   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "text": "operator CLI (pnpm cli):\n  fact-check start\n  claim create / jury run\n  votes commit / reveal\n  finalize\n  events follow --json\n\npublic CLI (pnpm ov):\n  weather / board / claims\n  agents / agent / extract\n  submit / status / watch\n  audit / trace\n  no key, no wallet\n\nagent skill openverdict\n  (skills/openverdict, served\n  at /SKILL.md; Claude Code,\n  Codex, Cursor, Gemini CLI,\n  Copilot and any Agent Skills\n  reader): navigates the whole\n  app and explains any verdict",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "operator CLI (pnpm cli):\n  fact-check start\n  claim create / jury run\n  votes commit / reveal\n  finalize\n  events follow --json\n\npublic CLI (pnpm ov):\n  weather / board / claims\n  agents / agent / extract\n  submit / status / watch\n  audit / trace\n  no key, no wallet\n\nagent skill openverdict\n  (skills/openverdict, served\n  at /SKILL.md; Claude Code,\n  Codex, Cursor, Gemini CLI,\n  Copilot and any Agent Skills\n  reader): navigates the whole\n  app and explains any verdict",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "baseline": 12
