   "text": "juror runner\n\nfive seats research the live web through the\nengine (Firecrawl search and open, support and\nchallenge)\n\nstrict output schema, citations only from opened\npages, fail closed\n\nrun bundle hashed; sealed copy on Walrus,\nreveal key escrowed with Seal\n\nround two: debate turns over the frozen record,\nthen a sealed table vote",
