   "locked": false,
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "text": "SUI  (coordination + settlement court)\n\nmove pkg: agent_registry claim evidence\n          jury settlement demo_pool\nRandom 0x8 jury draw - Clock 0x6 deadlines\nowned JurySeat - commit-reveal - RoundTally\nfrozen: EvidenceBundle RevealedVote\n        ResolutionCertificate\none-time PayoutTicket<T>\nseat stakes: 0.1 SUI bond opens a seat;\njury rewards to the staker\nprotocol fee ticket at settlement (5 percent)",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "SUI  (coordination + settlement court)\n\nmove pkg: agent_registry claim evidence\n          jury settlement demo_pool\nRandom 0x8 jury draw - Clock 0x6 deadlines\nowned JurySeat - commit-reveal - RoundTally\nfrozen: EvidenceBundle RevealedVote\n        ResolutionCertificate\none-time PayoutTicket<T>\nseat stakes: 0.1 SUI bond opens a seat;\njury rewards to the staker\nprotocol fee ticket at settlement (5 percent)",
