   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "text": "OBSERVER DASHBOARD  (Next.js - optional)\n\n/fact-check form - claim timeline\nChat and Graph views of the jury, debate dock,\nattempt n of 3, refusal shows the family health\nSSE + Last-Event-ID resume\n/verify: commitments recomputed client-side, 15 run checks,\nSeal recovery, juror re-run\nno signer; only the guarded public writes (submit,\nextract, stake prepare and confirm, register); every\nverdict recomputable from public data",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "OBSERVER DASHBOARD  (Next.js - optional)\n\n/fact-check form - claim timeline\nChat and Graph views of the jury, debate dock,\nattempt n of 3, refusal shows the family health\nSSE + Last-Event-ID resume\n/verify: commitments recomputed client-side, 15 run checks,\nSeal recovery, juror re-run\nno signer; only the guarded public writes (submit,\nextract, stake prepare and confirm, register); every\nverdict recomputable from public data",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
